nlow horizon composition,\nrule of thirds,\nsubject placed off-center,\ndeep spatial layering,\nforeground grass, midground path, background sky,\nsubtle motion blur in clouds and grass,\nhigh dynamic range (HDR),\nsoft bloom on highlights\n\n🌈【光影 Prompt（非常重要）】\n\nsoft natural lighting,\ngolden hour light,\ndiffused sunlight through thin clouds,\nvolumetric light rays,\ngentle rim light on grass and figure,\nno harsh contrast,\nsmooth tonal transitions\n\n🚫【负面 Prompt（Negative Prompt）】\n\nlow quality,\noversaturated colors,\nharsh lighting,\nstrong contrast,\ncrowded scene,\nmodern city,\nbuildings,\ncars,\ntext,\nwatermark,\nlogo,\nanime style,\ncartoon,\nexaggerated fantasy elements,\nsharp digital noise,\nugly composition\n\n🧠【一句“灵魂提示”（可放在 Prompt 最后）】\n\nthe world feels vast, quiet, and gentle, as if time has slowed down to let the soul breathe"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 44, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [410, 370], "pos": [450.2638244628906, 305.2545166015625], "id": 45, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [43], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [260, 110], "pos": [130.26380920410156, 735.2545166015625], "widgets_values": [1920, 1088, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name":